{"assets":["/statement-assets/89bebd59aaee20fde2c02d7dd4ad7298b79ea10e98748fbc49e7a21ba32be980.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1702","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G2. Passable Paths (hard version)"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is a hard version of the problem. The only difference between an easy and a hard version is in the number of queries."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polycarp grew a tree from $$$n$$$ vertices. We remind you that a tree of $$$n$$$ vertices is an undirected connected graph of $$$n$$$ vertices and $$$n-1$$$ edges that does not contain cycles."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"He calls a set of vertices "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"passable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if there is such a path in the tree that passes through each vertex of this set without passing through any edge twice. The path can visit other vertices (not from this set)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In other words, a set of vertices is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"passable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if there is a simple path that passes through all the vertices of this set (and possibly some other)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, for a tree below sets $$$\\{3, 2, 5\\}$$$, $$$\\{1, 5, 4\\}$$$, $$$\\{1, 4\\}$$$ are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"passable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and $$$\\{1, 3, 5\\}$$$, $$$\\{1, 2, 3, 4, 5\\}$$$ are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/89bebd59aaee20fde2c02d7dd4ad7298b79ea10e98748fbc49e7a21ba32be980.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polycarp asks you to answer $$$q$$$ queries. Each query is a set of vertices. For each query, you need to determine whether the corresponding set of vertices is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"passable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — number of vertices."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Following $$$n - 1$$$ lines a description of the tree.."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each line contains two integers $$$u$$$ and $$$v$$$ ($$$1 \\le u, v \\le n$$$, $$$u \\ne v$$$) — indices of vertices connected by an edge."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Following line contains single integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 10^5$$$) — number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following $$$2 \\cdot q$$$ lines contain descriptions of sets."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the description contains an integer $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le k \\le n$$$) — the size of the set."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the description contains $$$k$$$ of distinct integers $$$p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_k$$$ ($$$1 \\le p_i \\le n$$$) — indices of the vertices of the set."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$k$$$ values for all queries does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output $$$q$$$ lines, each of which contains the answer to the corresponding query. As an answer, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if the set is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"passable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output the answer in any case (for example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will be recognized as a positive answer)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1 2\n2 3\n2 4\n4 5\n5\n3\n3 2 5\n5\n1 2 3 4 5\n2\n1 4\n3\n1 3 5\n3\n1 5 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nYES\nNO\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1 2\n3 2\n2 4\n5 2\n4\n2\n3 1\n3\n3 4 5\n3\n2 3 5\n1\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G2","problemCode":"1702G2","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1702/problem/G2"}